          "settings": {
            "background_color": "rgba(0,0,0,0)",
            "title": "Vinyl flooring for kitchens",
            "content": "<p>As one of the largest areas in the room, your choice of floor will have a massive impact on the look and feel of your kitchen. We offer everything from the lightest shades of stone and tile effect vinyl, through to warm and rustic looking wood finishes, in dark and light tones, together with striking geometric tile effects to contrast or compliment your units and other décor.</p>\n<p>Cushioned backing adds extra warmth and comfort and of course, all vinyl is water resistant, easy to clean and it’s affordable too. Most of our vinyls are also compatible with underfloor heating systems and can be fitted with additional foam underlay for an even softer feel underfoot. Sweep it, mop it, clean up spills with ease. Vinyl is undoubtedly one of most practical choices for any kitchen area.</p>",
