            "content": "<p>For a luxurious feel, take a look at our extensive range of laminate flooring. It’s a practical alternative to vinyl and with the latest modern styles and designs it can replicate the look of stone or wooden planks to make it almost impossible to tell apart from the real thing.</p>\n<p>Three dimensional, embossed finishes, V-Groove and high definition will make your floor look amazing. Lay with underlay to dampen sound and add insulation and you’ll have a floor that’s comfortable, quiet and infinitely practical.</p>",
